{
  "summary": "This experiment tested a multimodal multiprofile model using pca_n2000 RNA encoder (vs. scvi_n200) with resnet50 image encoder and avgpool aggregation. The validation accuracy of 0.6186 is lower than the scvi_n200-based setup (config_031), suggesting the RNA encoder's quality may influence performance. Uncertainty remains about the relative impact of encoder choices versus fusion/aggregation strategies, as other factors like modality integration or interaction effects are not isolated."
}

